#. translators: %s: number of seconds, e.g. 4.2.
msgid "%s seconds (from banner shown to the visitor’s choice)."
msgstr ""
"%s soicind (ón mbanner a thaispeántar don chuairteoir go dtí an rogha)."

msgid ""
"A small icon-only button that lets visitors reopen the cookie settings after"
" they have made a choice. It is automatically hidden while the banner or "
"preferences dialog is open."
msgstr ""
"Cnaipe beag gan ach deilbhín a ligeann do chuairteoirí socruithe na bhfianán"
" a oscailt arís tar éis dóibh rogha a dhéanamh. Cuirtear i bhfolach go "
"huathoibríoch é fad is atá an banna nó an dialóg sainroghanna oscailte."

msgid "About"
msgstr "Faoi"

msgid "About Lynbro Cookie Consent"
msgstr "Faoi Lynbro Cookie Consent"

