msgid ""
"Add a small language dropdown to the banner so visitors can switch language "
"manually (their choice is remembered)."
msgstr ""
"Cuir liosta anuas beag teanga leis an mbanner ionas gur féidir le "
"cuairteoirí an teanga a athrú de láimh (cuimhnítear ar a rogha)."

msgid "Add your privacy policy link"
msgstr "Cuir nasc do do pholasaí príobháideachais leis"

msgid "Additional CSS"
msgstr "CSS breise"

msgid ""
"Allow the website to remember choices you make (such as language or region) "
"to provide enhanced, personalized features."
msgstr ""
"Lig don suíomh cuimhneamh ar na roghanna a dhéanann tú (amhail teanga nó "
"réigiún) chun gnéithe feabhsaithe, pearsantaithe a sholáthar."

