msgstr "Staitisticí anaithnid"

msgid "Auto (follow visitor’s system)"
msgstr "Uathoibríoch (lean córas an chuairteora)"

msgid "Auto by region"
msgstr "Uathoibríoch de réir réigiúin"

msgid "Auto by region (EU opt-in, US opt-out, rest by choice)"
msgstr ""
"Uathoibríoch de réir réigiúin (rogha isteach san AE, rogha amach sna Stáit "
"Aontaithe, an chuid eile de réir rogha)"

msgid ""
"Auto uses the light colors by default and the dark colors when the visitor’s"
" device prefers a dark color scheme."
msgstr ""
"Úsáideann Uathoibríoch na dathanna éadroma de réir réamhshocraithe agus na "
"dathanna dorcha nuair is fearr le gléas an chuairteora scéim datha dorcha."

msgid "Auto-block trackers"
msgstr "Blocáil uathoibríoch lorgairí"

msgid "Auto-detect visitor language"
msgstr "Braith teanga an chuairteora go huathoibríoch"

msgid "Automatic tracker blocking"
msgstr "Blocáil uathoibríoch lorgairí"

msgid ""
"Automatically block known third-party trackers (Google Analytics, GTM, Meta "
"Pixel, Hotjar, Clarity, and more) until the matching category is granted."
msgstr ""
"Cuir bac go huathoibríoch ar lorgairí aitheanta tríú páirtí (Google "
"Analytics, GTM, Meta Pixel, Hotjar, Clarity, agus eile) go dtí go dtugtar "
"cead don chatagóir chomhfhreagrach."

msgid ""
"Automatically show the banner in the visitor’s browser language when it is "
"one of the offered languages."
msgstr ""
"Taispeáin an banna go huathoibríoch i dteanga bhrabhsálaí an chuairteora "
"nuair is ceann de na teangacha tairgtear í."

msgid "Average time to decision"
msgstr "Meán-am go cinneadh"

msgid "Background color"
msgstr "Dath cúlra"

msgid "Banner background"
msgstr "Cúlra an bhanna"

msgid "Banner description"
msgstr "Cur síos an bhanna"

msgid "Banner max width (px)"
msgstr "Uasleithead an bhanna (px)"

msgid "Banner shown"
msgstr "Banna taispeánta"

msgid "Banner text on background"
msgstr "Téacs an bhanna ar an gcúlra"

msgid "Banner title"
msgstr "Teideal an bhanna"

msgid ""
"Base z-index for the banner, overlay, modal and floating button. Increase it"
" if another element covers the banner; lower it if the banner covers "
"something it should not."
msgstr ""
"Bun-z-index don bhanna, don fhorleagan, don mhodúl agus don chnaipe ar "
"snámh. Méadaigh é má chlúdaíonn eilimint eile an banna; laghdaigh é má "
"chlúdaíonn an banna rud nár cheart dó a chlúdach."

msgid ""
"Basic HTML allowed: links, bold, italic, line breaks. Leave empty for the "
"translated default."
msgstr ""
"Ceadaítear HTML bunúsach: naisc, trom, iodálach, briseadh líne. Fág bán é "
"don réamhshocrú aistrithe."

msgid "Benchmark sharing"
msgstr "Comhroinnt tagarmharcála"

msgid ""
"Benchmark sharing is on. Your first comparison will appear here after the "
"weekly report has run."
msgstr ""
"Tá comhroinnt tagarmharcála ar siúl. Beidh do chéad chomparáid le feiceáil "
"anseo tar éis don tuarascáil sheachtainiúil rith."

msgid ""
"Block embedded content (YouTube, Vimeo, Google Maps, social embeds, "
"reCAPTCHA, and more) until consent, showing a tidy placeholder with an "
"\"allow\" button."
msgstr ""
"Cuir bac ar inneachar leabaithe (YouTube, Vimeo, Google Maps, leabuithe "
"sóisialta, reCAPTCHA, agus eile) go dtí go dtugtar toiliú, agus taispeáin "
"áitshealbhóir néata le cnaipe \"ceadaigh\"."

