msgid ""
"Collect anonymous statistics (how many visitors accept, reject or open "
"preferences). Fully aggregated and cookieless — no IP address or personal "
"data is stored. Shown in the Statistics tab."
msgstr ""
"Bailigh staitisticí anaithnid (cé mhéad cuairteoir a ghlacann, a dhiúltaíonn"
" nó a osclaíonn roghanna). Go hiomlán comhiomlánaithe agus gan fianáin — ní "
"stóráiltear seoladh IP ná sonraí pearsanta. Taispeántar sa chluaisín "
"Staitisticí."

msgid ""
"Comma-separated page/post IDs where the banner should not be shown (e.g. "
"landing pages)."
msgstr ""
"Aitheantais leathanaigh/phoist scartha le camóga nach mór an meirge a "
"thaispeáint orthu (m.sh. leathanaigh tuirlingthe)."

msgid ""
"Configure your GDPR/ePrivacy and Google Consent Mode v2 cookie banner. This "
"plugin helps with compliance but does not constitute legal advice."
msgstr ""
"Cumraigh do mheirge fianán GDPR/ePrivacy agus Google Consent Mode v2. "
"Cabhraíonn an breiseán seo le comhlíonadh ach ní comhairle dlí é."

