" — ach amháin má tá nóiméad agat."

msgid ""
"Enter a WordPress locale code (for example pt_PT or ca) to offer a language "
"that is not bundled. After saving, fill in its texts below."
msgstr ""
"Cuir cód locale WordPress isteach (mar shampla pt_PT nó ca) chun teanga nach"
" bhfuil cuachta a thairiscint. Tar éis duit a shábháil, líon isteach a "
"téacsanna thíos."

