msgstr "Luchtaigh ábhar ó %s"

msgid "Local consent log"
msgstr "Log logánta toilithe"

msgid "Low contrast (%s:1). Aim for at least 4.5:1 to meet WCAG AA."
msgstr ""
"Codarsnacht íseal (%s:1). Aidhm ar a laghad 4.5:1 chun WCAG AA a "
"chomhlíonadh."

msgid ""
"Lynbro Cookie Consent is a free, privacy-first cookie banner built by "
"Lynbro. Our goal is a beautiful, genuinely multilingual, GDPR/ePrivacy-ready"
" banner with an equal Reject button — and no pageview limits, no paywall on "
"the essentials, and no front-end tracking."
msgstr ""
"Is bratach fianán saor in aisce, príobháideachas ar dtús é Lynbro Cookie "
"Consent a thóg Lynbro. Is é ár gcuspóir bratach álainn, fíor-ilteangach, "
"réidh do GDPR/ePrivacy — le cnaipe Diúltaigh ar chomhchéim — agus gan "
"teorainneacha amhairc leathanaigh, gan balla íocaíochta ar na "
"bunriachtanais, agus gan aon rianú ar an taobh tosaigh."

msgid "Manage opened"
msgstr "Bainistigh oscailte"

msgid "Manage preferences"
msgstr "Bainistigh sainroghanna"

msgid "Manage-preferences button"
msgstr "Cnaipe bainistigh sainroghanna"

msgid "Marketing"
msgstr "Margaíocht"

msgid ""
"Maximum width of the floating box and center modal. Set 0 to use the "
"default."
msgstr ""
"An leithead uasta don bhosca ar snámh agus don mhodal lárnach. Socraigh 0 "
"chun an réamhshocrú a úsáid."

msgid "Message"
msgstr "Teachtaireacht"

msgid "Method"
msgstr "Modh"

msgid "Mobile"
msgstr "Fón póca"

msgid "Necessary"
msgstr "Riachtanach"

msgid ""
"Necessary cookies are always active and cannot be disabled. Choose which "
"optional categories visitors can control."
msgstr ""
"Bíonn fianáin riachtanacha gníomhach i gcónaí agus ní féidir iad a "
"dhíchumasú. Roghnaigh cé na catagóirí roghnacha is féidir le cuairteoirí a "
"rialú."

msgid ""
"Need a language that is not bundled? Request it and we will generate it for "
"your site. The translation file is stored in your uploads folder (never "
"overwritten on update) and activated automatically."
msgstr ""
"An bhfuil teanga uait nach bhfuil cuimsithe? Iarr í agus ginfimid í do do "
"shuíomh. Stóráiltear an comhad aistriúcháin i d’fhillteán uaslódálacha (ní "
"dhéantar é a fhor-scríobh riamh ar nuashonrú) agus cuirtear i ngníomh go "
"huathoibríoch é."

