msgstr "Níl aon taifid toilithe fós."

msgid "No data yet."
msgstr "Níl aon sonraí fós."

msgid "No file was uploaded."
msgstr "Níor uaslódáladh aon chomhad."

msgid "No thanks, don’t show this again"
msgstr "Níl, go raibh maith agat, ná taispeáin é seo arís"

