msgstr "Glac isteach i ngach áit (GDPR — is sábháilte)"

msgid "Opt-out everywhere"
msgstr "Diúltaigh i ngach áit"

msgid "Opt-out everywhere (CCPA style)"
msgstr "Diúltaigh i ngach áit (stíl CCPA)"

msgid ""
"Optional CSS appended to the banner stylesheet. Target the .lynbro-cc "
"selectors."
msgstr ""
"CSS roghnach curtha leis an stílbhileog meirge. Dírigh ar na roghnóirí "
".lynbro-cc."

msgid "Other"
msgstr "Eile"

msgid ""
"Override any banner text for a specific language. Leave a field empty to use"
" the bundled translation (or the English default). Priority: your override →"
" bundled translation → default."
msgstr ""
"Sáraigh aon téacs meirge do theanga ar leith. Fág réimse folamh chun an "
"t-aistriúchán cuachta a úsáid (nó an réamhshocrú Béarla). Tosaíocht: do "
"shárú → aistriúchán cuachta → réamhshocrú."

msgid "Overview"
msgstr "Forbhreathnú"

msgid "Period"
msgstr "Tréimhse"

msgid "Please choose a valid language code."
msgstr "Roghnaigh cód teanga bailí."

msgid "Please enter a message before sending."
msgstr "Cuir teachtaireacht isteach sula seoltar."

msgid "Please upload a .json settings file."
msgstr "Uaslódáil comhad socruithe .json, le do thoil."

msgid "Plugin home page"
msgstr "Leathanach baile an bhreiseáin"

msgid "Policy URL"
msgstr "URL an bheartais"

msgid "Policy version"
msgstr "Leagan an bheartais"

msgid "Position"
msgstr "Suíomh"

msgid "Preferences"
msgstr "Sainroghanna"

msgid "Privacy Policy & Terms"
msgstr "Polasaí Príobháideachais & Téarmaí"

msgid "Privacy/Cookie policy URL"
msgstr "URL an pholasaí príobháideachais/fianán"

msgid ""
"Private, cookieless statistics stored only in your own database. They are "
"fully aggregated — no IP address, no visitor identifier and no personal data"
" is ever recorded. Because of that, these statistics do not by themselves "
"require consent."
msgstr ""
"Staitisticí príobháideacha, gan fianáin, a stóráiltear i do bhunachar sonraí"
" féin amháin. Déantar iad a chomhthiomsú go hiomlán — ní thaifeadtar seoladh"
" IP, aitheantóir cuairteora ná aon sonra pearsanta riamh. Dá bhrí sin, ní "
"éilíonn na staitisticí seo toiliú astu féin."

msgid "Read more"
msgstr "Léigh tuilleadh"

msgid "Recent consent records"
msgstr "Taifid toiliú le déanaí"

msgid ""
"Records older than this are deleted automatically. Set to 0 to keep records "
"indefinitely."
msgstr ""
"Scriostar taifid níos sine ná seo go huathoibríoch. Socraigh go 0 chun na "
"taifid a choinneáil go buan."

msgid "Region"
msgstr "Réigiún"

msgid ""
"Region is detected from CDN/edge headers (e.g. Cloudflare). When unknown, "
"the safest opt-in model is used. No external geolocation API is called."
msgstr ""
"Aimsítear an réigiún ó cheanntásca CDN/imeall (m.sh. Cloudflare). Nuair nach"
" bhfuil sé ar eolas, úsáidtear an tsamhail opt-in is sábháilte. Ní "
"ghlaoitear API geolocation seachtrach."

msgid ""
"Register as the consent provider for the WP Consent API plugin and notify "
"other plugins of the visitor’s choice (functional, preferences, statistics, "
"marketing)."
msgstr ""
"Cláraigh mar sholáthraí toilithe don bhreiseán WP Consent API agus cuir in "
"iúl do bhreiseáin eile rogha an chuairteora (feidhmiúil, sainroghanna, "
"staitisticí, margaíocht)."

msgid "Reject all"
msgstr "Diúltaigh do chách"

msgid "Reject button"
msgstr "Cnaipe diúltaithe"

msgid "Report a bug"
msgstr "Tuairiscigh fabht"

msgid "Request a language"
msgstr "Iarr teanga"

msgid "Request this language"
msgstr "Iarr an teanga seo"

msgid ""
"Required for the website to function and cannot be switched off. They are "
"usually set in response to actions you make, such as setting privacy "
"preferences or logging in."
msgstr ""
"Riachtanach chun go bhfeidhmeodh an suíomh gréasáin agus ní féidir iad a "
"mhúchadh. De ghnáth socraítear iad mar fhreagairt ar ghníomhartha a dhéanann"
" tú, amhail do shainroghanna príobháideachais a shocrú nó logáil isteach."

msgid ""
"Resting transparency (0.2–1.0). The button becomes fully opaque on hover or "
"focus. Default is 0.55."
msgstr ""
"Trédhearcacht ag an gcuid eile (0.2–1.0). Éiríonn an cnaipe go hiomlán "
"teimhneach ar hover nó ar fhócas. Is é 0.55 an réamhshocrú."

msgid "Retention (days)"
msgstr "Coinneáil (laethanta)"

msgid "Round"
msgstr "Babhta"

msgid "Rounded"
msgstr "Slánaithe"

msgid ""
"Rounding of the banner, box and modal corners. Set 0 to use the default."
msgstr ""
"Slánú na gcoirnéal ar an meirge, ar an mbosca agus ar an mhódal. Socraigh 0 "
"chun an réamhshocrú a úsáid."

msgid "Save language settings"
msgstr "Sábháil socruithe teanga"

msgid "Save preferences"
msgstr "Sábháil sainroghanna"

msgid "Save-preferences button"
msgstr "Cnaipe Sábháil na sainroghanna"

msgid "Send feedback"
msgstr "Seol aiseolas"

#. translators: %s: link to the portal privacy/terms page.
msgid ""
"Sends only the plugin name, version and language code to the Lynbro portal. "
"See our %s."
msgstr ""
"Seolann sé ainm an bhreiseáin, an leagan agus cód teanga amháin chuig "
"tairseach Lynbro. Féach ar ár %s."

msgid "Set"
msgstr "Socraigh"

msgid ""
"Sets all consent signals to \"denied\" by default before consent, then "
"updates them based on the visitor’s choice (ad_storage, analytics_storage, "
"ad_user_data, ad_personalization, functionality_storage, "
"personalization_storage, security_storage)."
msgstr ""
"Socraíonn sé gach comhartha toilithe go “diúltaithe” de réir réamhshocraithe"
" roimh thoiliú, agus ansin nuashonraíonn sé iad bunaithe ar rogha an "
"chuairteora (ad_storage, analytics_storage, ad_user_data, "
"ad_personalization, functionality_storage, personalization_storage, "
"security_storage)."

msgid "Settings"
msgstr "Socruithe"

msgid "Settings imported successfully."
msgstr "Iompórtáladh na socruithe go rathúil."

msgid "Shape"
msgstr "Cruth"

msgid ""
"Share anonymous statistics to help improve the plugin — and see how your "
"accept rate compares to the average. Off by default. Sends only aggregated "
"numbers and your site domain (never visitor IPs) to the Lynbro portal, once "
"a week."
msgstr ""
"Comhroinn staitisticí anaithnide chun cabhrú leis an mbreiseán a fheabhsú — "
"agus féach conas a dhéanann do ráta glactha comparáid leis an meán. Múchta "
"de réir réamhshocraithe. Seolann sé uimhreacha comhiomlánaithe agus fearann "
"do shuímh amháin (riamh IPanna cuairteoirí) chuig tairseach Lynbro, uair sa "
"tseachtain."

msgid ""
"Show a \"Do Not Sell or Share My Personal Information\" link in opt-out "
"mode."
msgstr ""
"Taispeáin nasc “Ná Díol ná Comhroinn Mo Fhaisnéis Phearsanta” sa mhód "
"diúltaithe."

msgid "Show floating settings button on the site"
msgstr "Taispeáin cnaipe socruithe ar snámh ar an suíomh"

msgid "Show language switcher"
msgstr "Taispeáin lasc teanga"

msgid ""
"Show the cookie icon (recommended). When off, the accessible label is shown "
"as a small text button instead."
msgstr ""
"Taispeáin an deilbhín fianán (molta). Nuair atá sé múchta, taispeántar an "
"lipéad inrochtana mar chnaipe beag téacs ina áit."

msgid "Size (px)"
msgstr "Méid (px)"

msgid ""
"Sorry, that language could not be fetched right now. Please try again later."
msgstr ""
"Ár leithscéal, ní fhéadfaí an teanga sin a fháil faoi láthair. Déan iarracht"
" eile níos déanaí."

msgid "Sorry, the message could not be sent. Please try again later."
msgstr ""
"Ár leithscéal, ní fhéadfaí an teachtaireacht a sheoladh. Déan iarracht eile "
"níos déanaí."

msgid "Square"
msgstr "Cearnach"

msgid "Stacking (z-index base)"
msgstr "Cruacháil (bun-z-index)"

msgid "Statistics"
msgstr "Staitisticí"

msgid ""
"Statistics are currently turned off. Enable “Collect anonymous statistics” "
"in the General tab to start collecting aggregated numbers."
msgstr ""
"Tá staitisticí múchta faoi láthair. Cumasaigh “Bailigh staitisticí "
"anaithnide” sa chluaisín Ginearálta chun uimhreacha comhiomlánaithe a "
"bhailiú."

msgid "Statistics are disabled."
msgstr "Tá na staitisticí díchumasaithe."

msgid ""
"Store a privacy-respecting proof of consent in your own database. No raw IP "
"address is stored — only a salted, anonymised hash for de-duplication."
msgstr ""
"Stóráil cruthúnas toilithe atá measúil ar phríobháideachas i do bhunachar "
"sonraí féin. Ní stóráiltear seoladh IP amh ar bith — ach hash saillte, "
"anaithnidithe le haghaidh dídhúblála."

msgid "Tablet"
msgstr "Táibléad"

msgid "Tell us what you think, what is missing, or what went wrong…"
msgstr ""
"Inis dúinn cad a cheapann tú, cad atá in easnamh, nó cad a chuaigh mícheart…"

msgid "Text color"
msgstr "Dath an téacs"

msgid "Thank you! Your message was sent."
msgstr "Go raibh maith agat! Cuireadh do theachtaireacht."

#. translators: %s: the average accept rate across opted-in sites.
msgid ""
"The average accept rate across opted-in sites is %s%%. Yours will show here "
"once visitors start choosing."
msgstr ""
"Is é %s%% an meánráta glactha ar fud na suíomhanna a roghnaigh isteach. "
"Taispeánfar do ráta anseo nuair a thosóidh cuairteoirí ag roghnú."

msgid ""
"The banner language follows a cache-safe cascade: the current page language "
"(Polylang/WPML/TranslatePress), then your site language, then English. "
"Browser auto-detection and the optional in-banner switcher happen entirely "
"in the visitor’s browser, so your page cache is never affected."
msgstr ""
"Leanann teanga an bhrataí cascad atá sábháilte don taisce: teanga reatha an "
"leathanaigh (Polylang/WPML/TranslatePress), ansin teanga do shuímh, ansin "
"Béarla. Tarlaíonn braite uathoibríoch an bhrabhsálaí agus an lasc roghnach "
"sa bhratach go hiomlán i mbrabhsálaí an chuairteora, mar sin ní dhéantar "
"difear riamh do thaisce do leathanaigh."

msgid "The file does not contain valid Lynbro Cookie Consent settings."
msgstr "Níl socruithe bailí Lynbro Cookie Consent sa chomhad seo."

msgid "Theme"
msgstr "Téama"

msgid ""
"These are the languages prepared for browser auto-detection and the "
"switcher. Languages with a bundled translation appear here automatically. "
"Your site language is always included."
msgstr ""
"Seo iad na teangacha ullmhaithe le haghaidh braite uathoibríoch an "
"bhrabhsálaí agus an lasc. Taispeántar teangacha le haistriúchán ionsuite "
"anseo go huathoibríoch. Bíonn teanga do shuímh san áireamh i gcónaí."

msgid ""
"This complements manual script marking. All detection is local; no external "
"request is made."
msgstr ""
"Comhlánaíonn sé seo marcáil láimhe scripteanna. Déantar an braite go "
"háitiúil; ní sheoltar aon iarratas seachtrach."

msgid ""
"This plugin helps with cookie compliance but does not constitute legal "
"advice."
msgstr ""
"Cuidíonn an breiseán seo le comhlíonadh fianán ach ní hionann é agus "
"comhairle dlí."

msgid ""
"Tip: cookie/consent wording can have legal implications. Have the legal "
"parts of any translation reviewed by a person familiar with your "
"jurisdiction."
msgstr ""
"Leid: is féidir impleachtaí dlí a bheith ag an bhfoclaíocht fianán/toilithe."
" Iarr ar dhuine atá eolach ar do dhlínse na codanna dlí de gach aistriúchán "
"a athbhreithniú."

msgid ""
"To view this content from %s, you need to accept the relevant cookies. The "
"provider may set cookies and collect personal data."
msgstr ""
"Chun an t-ábhar seo ó %s a fheiceáil, ní mór duit na fianáin ábhartha a "
"ghlacadh. Féadfaidh an soláthraí fianáin a shocrú agus sonraí pearsanta a "
"bhailiú."

msgid "Today"
msgstr "Inniu"

msgid "Too many requests."
msgstr "An iomarca iarratas."

msgid "Tools"
msgstr "Uirlisí"

msgid "Top bar"
msgstr "Barr na láimhe"

msgid "Top left"
msgstr "Barr ar chlé"

msgid "Top right"
msgstr "Barr ar dheis"

#. translators: %d: total number of consent records.
msgid "Total records: %d (showing the 50 most recent)."
msgstr "Taifid iomlána: %d (ag taispeáint na 50 is déanaí)."

msgid ""
"Unchecking this hides the floating button completely — visitors will not see"
" a way to reopen their cookie settings (unless you add the "
"[lynbro_cookie_settings] shortcode somewhere)."
msgstr ""
"Má dhíthiceáiltear é seo, cuirfear an cnaipe snámhach i bhfolach go hiomlán "
"— ní fheicfidh cuairteoirí bealach chun a socruithe fianán a athoscailt "
"(mura gcuireann tú an shortcode [lynbro_cookie_settings] áit éigin)."

msgid "Updates"
msgstr "Nuashonruithe"

msgid ""
"Updates are delivered automatically through WordPress.org — there is no "
"custom updater and the free version never phones home."
msgstr ""
"Seachadtar nuashonruithe go huathoibríoch trí WordPress.org — níl uasdátóir "
"saincheaptha ann agus ní ghlaonn an leagan saor ar ais choíche."

msgid ""
"Used as the tooltip and screen-reader label. Leave empty for the translated "
"default."
msgstr ""
"Úsáidtear é mar an leid uirlise agus mar lipéad léitheora scáileáin. Fág "
"folamh é don réamhshocrú aistrithe."

msgid "Used only when Position is \"Floating box\"."
msgstr "Úsáidtear é amháin nuair is \"Bosca snámhach\" an Suíomh."

msgid ""
"Used to track visitors across websites to display relevant advertising and "
"measure campaign effectiveness."
msgstr ""
"Úsáidtear é chun cuairteoirí a rianú ar fud suíomhannaéasáin chun fógraíocht"
" ábhartha a thaispeáint agus éifeachtacht feachtasaíochta a thomhas."

msgid "Version & updates"
msgstr "Leagan agus nuashonruithe"

msgid "Vertical"
msgstr "Ingearach"

msgid "View changelog"
msgstr "Féach ar an logáil athruithe"

msgid "Visibility"
msgstr "Infheictheacht"

msgid "Visit Lynbro"
msgstr "Tabhair cuairt ar Lynbro"

msgid "WP Consent API"
msgstr "API Toilithe WP"

msgid ""
"We detected a Global Privacy Control signal and automatically opted you out "
"of non-essential cookies."
msgstr ""
"Braitheadh comhartha um Rialú Príobháideachais Domhanda agus cuireadh ar "
"neamhrogha tú go huathoibríoch ó fhianáin nach bhfuil riachtanach."

msgid ""
"We use cookies to enhance your browsing experience, serve personalized "
"content and analyze our traffic. You can accept all cookies, reject non-"
"essential ones, or manage your preferences."
msgstr ""
"Úsáidimid fianáin chun feabhas a chur ar do thaithí brabhsála, ábhar "
"pearsantaithe a sheirbheáil agus ár dtrácht a anailísiú. Is féidir leat "
"glacadh le gach fianán, fianáin neamhriachtanacha a dhiúltú, nó do "
"shainroghanna a bhainistiú."

msgid "We value your privacy"
msgstr "Is mór againn do phríobháideachas"

msgid "Width and height of the button (24–96). Default is 40."
msgstr "Leithead agus airde an chnaipe (24–96). Is é 40 an réamhshocrú."

msgid "Windows"
msgstr "Windows"

msgid "Write a review"
msgstr "Scríobh léirmheas"

msgid "Yesterday"
msgstr "Inné"

msgid "You can still block your own scripts manually:"
msgstr "Is féidir leat do chuid scripteanna féin a bhlocáil de láimh fós:"

msgid "You do not have sufficient permissions to access this page."
msgstr ""
"Níl ceadanna leordhóthanacha agat chun rochtain a fháil ar an leathanach "
"seo."

#. translators: 1: this site's accept rate, 2: the average accept rate across
#. opted-in sites.
msgid ""
"Your accept rate over the last 7 days is %1$s%%. The average across opted-in"
" sites is %2$s%%."
msgstr ""
"Is é do ráta glactha le 7 lá anuas ná %1$s%%. Is é an meán ar fud na "
"suíomhanna atá tar éis roghnú isteach ná %2$s%%."

msgid "Your consent banner is live"
msgstr "Tá do bhratach toilithe beo"

msgid "Your email (optional)"
msgstr "Do ríomhphost (roghnach)"

#. translators: %s: link to the portal privacy/terms page.
msgid ""
"Your message, the plugin version and your site domain are sent to the Lynbro"
" portal. See our %s."
msgstr ""
"Seoltar do theachtaireacht, leagan an bhreiseáin agus fearann do shuímh "
"chuig an tairseach Lynbro. Féach ar ár %s."

msgid "\"Read more\" link"
msgstr "Nasc \"Léigh níos mó\""

msgid "iOS"
msgstr "iOS"

msgid "macOS"
msgstr "macOS"

msgid "site language"
msgstr "teanga an tsuímh"

msgid ""
"Preparing your language… This can take about a minute the first time. It "
"will be added automatically — you can keep working."
msgstr ""
"Ag ullmhú do theanga… Féadfaidh sé seo thart ar nóiméad a thógáil an chéad "
"uair. Cuirfear leis go huathoibríoch é — is féidir leat leanúint ar aghaidh "
"ag obair."

#. %s: comma-separated list of language names.
msgid "Language ready and activated: %s"
msgstr "Teanga réidh agus gníomhachtaithe: %s"

#. %s: comma-separated list of language names.
msgid "Could not prepare: %s. Please try again later."
msgstr "Níorbh fhéidir a ullmhú: %s. Bain triail eile as níos déanaí."

msgid "Accessibility"
msgstr "Inrochtaineacht"

msgid ""
"Apply this design preset? It will overwrite your current Design settings "
"(you can still review before saving)."
msgstr ""
"An gcuirfear an réamhshocrú dearaidh seo i bhfeidhm? Scriosfaidh sé do "
"shocruithe Dearaidh reatha (féadfaidh tú athbhreithniú a dhéanamh air sula "
"sábhálann tú fós)."

msgid "Calm, low-contrast palette in a rounded corner box."
msgstr "Pailéad ciúin, ísealchodarsnachta i mbosca le coirnéil chruinne."

msgid "Centered dialog with a dimmed overlay, dark theme."
msgstr "Dialóg lárnaithe le forleagan dorcha, téama dorcha."

msgid "Colours meet WCAG AA accessibility"
msgstr "Comhlíonann na dathanna inrochtaineacht WCAG AA"

msgid "Design presets"
msgstr "Réamhshocruithe dearaidh"

msgid "Details"
msgstr "Mionsonraí"

msgid "Full-width bar at the bottom, light and neutral."
msgstr "Barra lánleithid ag bun an leathanaigh, éadrom agus neodrach."

msgid "Hide details"
msgstr "Folaigh mionsonraí"

msgid ""
"One-click starting points. Applying a preset fills the Design fields below "
"and updates the live preview — review it, then Save Changes to keep it."
msgstr ""
"Tosphointí aon-cliceáil. Má chuirtear réamhshocrú i bhfeidhm, líontar na "
"réimsí Dearaidh thíos agus nuashonraítear an réamhamharc beo — déan "
"athbhreithniú air, ansin Sábháil na hAthruithe chun é a choimeád."

msgid "Preset applied. Review the preview, then Save Changes to keep it."
msgstr ""
"Cuireadh an réamhshocrú i bhfeidhm. Déan athbhreithniú ar an réamhamharc, "
"ansin Sábháil na hAthruithe chun é a choimeád."

msgid "Preview device width"
msgstr "Leithead an ghléis réamhamhairc"

msgid "Slim, square bar pinned to the top of the page."
msgstr "Barra caol, cearnógach ceangailte ag barr an leathanaigh."

msgid "Soft floating card in the bottom-right corner."
msgstr "Cárta bog ar snámh sa chúinne íochtarach ar dheis."

msgid "Some colours have low contrast (%s) — see details."
msgstr "Tá codarsnacht íseal i roinnt dathanna (%s) — féach na mionsonraí."
